  引数の形: {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["text"],"properties":{"text":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200}}}
- search_historical_route: 旧街道・古道（東海道五十三次・中山道など）の沿う宿場町を調べる
  引数の形: {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["name"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":40}}}
- calculate_route: スポットを回る順番を、移動がいちばん短くなるように並べる（巡回セールスマン問題の近似）
  引数の形: {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["spotIds"],"properties":{"spotIds":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":20,"items":{"type":"string","maxLength":80}},"start":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","maxLength":80},"lat":{"type":"number","minimum":-90,"maximum":90},"lng":{"type":"number","minimum":-180,"maximum":180}}}}}
- search_transit: 2地点の間の公共交通の経路と所要時間を調べる（引けないときは距離からの目安）
  引数の形: {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["from","to"],"properties":{"from":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","maxLength":80},"lat":{"type":"number","minimum":-90,"maximum":90},"lng":{"type":"number","minimum":-180,"maximum":180}}},"to":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","maxLength":80},"lat":{"type":"number","minimum":-90,"maximum":90},"lng":{"type":"number","minimum":-180,"maximum":180}}},"departAt":{"type":"string","maxLength":30}}}
