  引数の形: {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["query"],"properties":{"query":{"type":"string","minLength":2,"maxLength":80}}}
- ask_user: 決められないことを利用者に聞く（最後の手段）
  引数の形: {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["question"],"properties":{"question":{"type":"string","minLength":2,"maxLength":200},"choices":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"string","maxLength":40}}}}

